{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the atmosphere of Eastern European folklore, <strong>Awakeroots</strong> blends elements of <strong>survival, strategy, and RPG</strong>.<br>You\u2019ll take on the role of a settler and pioneer in a mysterious land where <strong>nature and magic intertwine</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Build and expand your settlement</strong><br>Start with nothing and grow a thriving village. Construct homes, workshops, storage buildings, and defensive walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Cultivate the land</strong><br>Plant, care for, and harvest crops using traditional methods. Your harvest may be your lifeline\u2014or your greatest asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Fortify and defend</strong><br>Prepare for danger from all sides. Strengthen your walls, set traps, and defend your people from what lurks beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Battle Slavic mythological beasts</strong><br>Face creatures pulled from ancient legends\u2014Leshy, Rusalka, Poludnica and more\u2014haunting the forests and forgotten ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Explore the wilds</strong><br>Venture through mysterious lands\u2014dense forests, swamps, mountains, and sacred ruins. Discover relics, hidden lore, and secrets of ancient tribes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Hand-crafted 2D art style</strong><br>A unique visual identity shaped by one of the creators, inspired by folk patterns and traditional Slavic ornamentation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>The spirit of the ancestors, the power of roots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awakeroots</strong> is a passion project\u2014crafted by two brothers who combine creativity with a deep love for Slavic culture and storytelling.<br>It\u2019s not just a game\u2014it\u2019s a journey into a world that could have been\u2026 and now awakens again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882880?t=1757192405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/6a90f7bfc7fb720bdc432fd780c449a4a2af3384/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757192405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/3d4da8ad0824b41cd8aa812e5d45b67632325295/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757192405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/3d4da8ad0824b41cd8aa812e5d45b67632325295/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757192405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the atmosphere of Eastern European folklore, <strong>Awakeroots</strong> blends elements of <strong>survival, strategy, and RPG</strong>.<br>You\u2019ll take on the role of a settler and pioneer in a mysterious land where <strong>nature and magic intertwine</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Build and expand your settlement</strong><br>Start with nothing and grow a thriving village. Construct homes, workshops, storage buildings, and defensive walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Cultivate the land</strong><br>Plant, care for, and harvest crops using traditional methods. Your harvest may be your lifeline\u2014or your greatest asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Fortify and defend</strong><br>Prepare for danger from all sides. Strengthen your walls, set traps, and defend your people from what lurks beyond.</p><p cla